<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle firm-up $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle firm-up $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were firm to $2.00 per cwt higher, compared to Monday's close, according to USDA.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 58.50-65.75; 700-800 lbs 59.00-65.75.</p>
<p>Small 1 300-400 lbs 54.50-55.00.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 2 pen 633 lbs 55.00.</p>
<p>Holsteins - Large 2 600-650 lbs few 42.00; 12 head 883 lbs 46.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs 52.50-60.25; 700-800 lbs few 58.00-60.75.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 2 - 500-600 lbs 47.00-52.50.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
